GuardDD 0.04
------------

This is a simple module which you can stick into your startup sequence to
guard DOS partitions over 2MB in size from being accidentally deleted.  If
you try, you'll get an error.  To kill the module, press F12 and type 'RMKill
GuardDD' at the * prompt.  If you want to delete just one partition, it's
probably better to bypass the protection by setting the partition's type to
Text and then deleting it.

